# Deploy preference

- After finishing code changes, run `scripts/deploy-ecs.ps1` to ECS (see `commit-and-sync.mdc`). Do **not** rely on GitHub Actions.
- Do **not** `git push` unless the user explicitly says **push** (or asks to sync remote git).
- Local commits happen automatically after finished work; push stays opt-in.
